---
// Email + WhatsApp only. No form, no LinkedIn, no GitHub.
---
<div
  class="relative isolate overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-8 sm:p-10"
>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--accent)]/10 to-transparent"
  >
  </div>

  <p class="max-w-2xl text-[var(--text-muted)]">
    ¿Tenés un proyecto en mente o un sitio que necesita mejoras? Escribime y lo conversamos sin
    compromiso.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap">
    <a
      href="mailto:gbarazzutti2@gmail.com"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-[var(--accent)] px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-[var(--on-accent)] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-[var(--accent-hover)] focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[var(--accent)]"
    >
      <svg
        class="size-5 shrink-0"
        aria-hidden="true"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      >
        <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"></rect>
        <path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"></path>
      </svg>
      gbarazzutti2@gmail.com
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://wa.me/5493813667657"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-[var(--accent)]/40 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-[var(--accent)]/10 focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[var(--accent)]"
    >
      <svg
        class="size-5 shrink-0"
        aria-hidden="true"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      >
        <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-8.5 8.5 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-4-1L3 20l1-5.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1-1-4 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 8.5-8.5A8.38 8.38 0 0 1 21 11.5z"></path>
        <path d="M8.5 8.5c0 3 2 5 5 5"></path>
      </svg>
      WhatsApp: +54 381 366 7657<span class="sr-only"> (abre en una pestaña nueva)</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
